"明"}},{"title":"浣灵卷为当涂李都宪作 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"万古天地中，此脉未应绝。\n拜读浣灵诗，一夜头尽白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11248,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茅林八景 其一 太山拥翠","author":"庄昶","text":"云水阁云峰，斜通幽鸟径。\n巨石莫相寻，茏葱看隐映。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11249,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茅林八景 其二 曲港拖蓝","author":"庄昶","text":"九皋昨夜露，孤鹤散清响。\n惊起弄波人，长啸星河上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11250,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茅林八景 其三 林溪渔钓","author":"庄昶","text":"白头据盘石，长竿弄烟水。\n为问梦中怨，孰与溪鱼美。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11251,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茅林八景 其四 禅寺晚钟","author":"庄昶","text":"暝翳寒城雨，明催古路人。\n胸中纷扰梦，断我几黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11252,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茅林八景 其五 龙潭秋月","author":"庄昶","text":"神物本天用，寒山深见底。\n不得抱珠眠，明年春雨里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11253,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茅林八景 其六 牛陇春云","author":"庄昶","text":"野外如膏雨，天边披絮云。\n眼前春事急，公是耦耕人。","coll